3. **Load Tests**: Validate backpressure handling under high throughput with bounded buffers
4. **Chaos Tests**: Random failures during migration to ensure data consistency
5. **Performance Benchmarks**: Measure reconfiguration latency and throughput impact

## Why This Is Asked
